  "transcript_source": "captions",
  "transcript": [
    {
      "s": 7.34,
      "e": 8.34,
      "text": "Nobody knew where we"
    },
    {
      "s": 8.34,
      "e": 9.84,
      "text": "would be 10 years ago."
    },
    {
      "s": 11.58,
      "e": 12.81,
      "text": "It got really quiet here"
    },
    {
      "s": 12.81,
      "e": 13.78,
      "text": "at the Kennedy Space Center."
    },
    {
      "s": 16.98,
      "e": 17.78,
      "text": "But I don't think"
    },
    {
      "s": 17.78,
      "e": 19.39,
      "text": "anyone really could have envisioned"
    },
    {
      "s": 19.39,
      "e": 20.35,
      "text": "where we are today."
    },
    {
      "s": 20.35,
      "e": 21.09,
      "text": "And liftoff!"
    },
    {
      "s": 21.09,
      "e": 22.52,
      "text": "Liftoff! Liftoff!"
    },
    {
      "s": 22.82,
      "e": 26.69,
      "text": "July 8, 2011"
    },
    {
      "s": 27.16,
      "e": 28.26,
      "text": "Today, weather permitting,"
    },
    {
      "s": 28.26,
      "e": 29.9,
      "text": "Atlantis will display its power"
    },
    {
      "s": 29.9,
      "e": 31.83,
      "text": "and spectacle one last time"
    },
    {
      "s": 31.83,
      "e": 32.83,
      "text": "under the direction of flight"
    },
    {
      "s": 32.83,
      "e": 34.4,
      "text": "director Richard Jones."
    },
    {
      "s": 35.0,
      "e": 36.6,
      "text": "The shuttle was sort of iconic."
    },
    {
      "s": 37.0,
      "e": 38.0,
      "text": "You know, there weren't many"
    },
    {
      "s": 38.57,
      "e": 40.04,
      "text": "spaceships that looked like it."
    },
    {
      "s": 40.04,
      "e": 41.94,
      "text": "There weren't any that landed like it."
    },
    {
      "s": 42.64,
      "e": 44.54,
      "text": "And I think it had become sort of"
    },
    {
      "s": 44.58,
      "e": 45.91,
      "text": "so commonplace."
    },
    {
      "s": 45.91,
      "e": 47.08,
      "text": "Yeah, you know, the shuttle flies"
    },
    {
      "s": 47.08,
      "e": 48.11,
      "text": "six times a year."
    },
    {
      "s": 48.45,
      "e": 49.35,
      "text": "It has done it ever"
    },
    {
      "s": 49.35,
      "e": 50.65,
      "text": "since I was a little kid"
    },
    {
      "s": 50.65,
      "e": 51.95,
      "text": "or even before I was born."
    },
    {
      "s": 52.62,
      "e": 54.15,
      "text": "And I think it just became a bit"
    },
    {
      "s": 54.15,
      "e": 55.59,
      "text": "of a surprise to the world"
    },
    {
      "s": 55.59,
      "e": 56.79,
      "text": "that, wow, it's it's"
    },
    {
      "s": 56.79,
      "e": 57.76,
      "text": "not going to fly anymore."
    },
    {
      "s": 61.06,
      "e": 63.73,
      "text": "Here's our commander, Chris Ferguson."
    },
    {
      "s": 64.23,
      "e": 66.07,
      "text": "He's in the suit up room."
    },
    {
      "s": 66.07,
      "e": 68.7,
      "text": "Going over to pilot Doug Hurley."
    },
    {
      "s": 69.1,
      "e": 70.47,
      "text": "And here is mission"
    },
    {
      "s": 70.47,
      "e": 72.61,
      "text": "specialist number one, Sandy Magnus."
    },
    {
      "s": 72.81,
      "e": 74.34,
      "text": "This is Rex Walheim."
    },
    {
      "s": 74.94,
      "e": 76.84,
      "text": "He's our mission specialist number two."
    },
    {
      "s": 77.31,
      "e": 79.78,
      "text": "He's making his third space flight."
    },
    {
      "s": 79.81,
      "e": 82.08,
      "text": "He spent more than 24 days in space."
    },
    {
      "s": 82.38,
      "e": 83.65,
      "text": "It was a real honor"
    },
    {
      "s": 83.85,
      "e": 85.98,
      "text": "to be a part of the last shuttle"
    },
    {
      "s": 85.98,
      "e": 87.55,
      "text": "mission, STS- 135,"
    },
    {
      "s": 88.25,
      "e": 89.42,
      "text": "because it's such -"
    },
    {
      "s": 89.42,
      "e": 90.76,
      "text": "it was such an important mission"
    },
    {
      "s": 90.76,
      "e": 93.53,
      "text": "from the viewpoint of really showcasing"
    },
    {
      "s": 93.96,
      "e": 95.9,
      "text": "what the shuttle program accomplished"
    },
    {
      "s": 95.93,
      "e": 97.43,
      "text": "during its so 30 years."
    },
    {
      "s": 99.16,
      "e": 100.3,
      "text": "And here they come."
    },
    {
      "s": 100.73,
      "e": 101.87,
      "text": "I was looked upon a shuttle"
    },
    {
      "s": 101.87,
      "e": 104.57,
      "text": "flight is like preparing for Christmas."
    },
    {
      "s": 104.74,
      "e": 105.07,
      "text": "You know,"
    },
    {
      "s": 105.74,
      "e": 107.31,
      "text": "all the work is done ahead of time."
    },
    {
      "s": 108.27,
      "e": 109.38,
      "text": "You know, all the shopping"
    },
    {
      "s": 109.38,
      "e": 110.01,
      "text": "and the cooking."
    },
    {
      "s": 110.01,
      "e": 111.31,
      "text": "And that's what the training is like."
    },
    {
      "s": 111.88,
      "e": 112.58,
      "text": "You know, when you launch,"
    },
    {
      "s": 112.58,
      "e": 113.48,
      "text": "it's like Christmas Day."
    },
    {
      "s": 113.51,
      "e": 115.25,
      "text": "You get - if you did everything"
    },
    {
      "s": 115.25,
      "e": 116.58,
      "text": "the right way, preparing for it,"
    },
    {
      "s": 116.65,
      "e": 117.65,
      "text": "it's it's all fun."
    },
    {
      "s": 121.45,
      "e": 123.62,
      "text": "Jones has already polled his team for a"
    },
    {
      "s": 123.62,
      "e": 126.23,
      "text": "go for launch from a systems perspective,"
    },
    {
      "s": 126.56,
      "e": 128.83,
      "text": "as has the International Space Station"
    },
    {
      "s": 128.83,
      "e": 130.36,
      "text": "flight control team led today"
    },
    {
      "s": 130.36,
      "e": 132.16,
      "text": "by flight director Emily Nelson."
    },
    {
      "s": 133.2,
      "e": 135.07,
      "text": "This is an incredibly experienced"
    },
    {
      "s": 135.07,
      "e": 135.9,
      "text": "and dedicated team"
    },
    {
      "s": 136.24,
      "e": 137.6,
      "text": "that gets the people on the orbiter."
    },
    {
      "s": 138.4,
      "e": 144.74,
      "text": "[music builds]"
    },
    {
      "s": 145.31,
      "e": 146.78,
      "text": "OK, Fergie, we're starting to feel"
    },
    {
      "s": 146.78,
      "e": 147.55,
      "text": "pretty good down here"
    },
    {
      "s": 147.55,
      "e": 148.88,
      "text": "on the ground about this one today."
    },
    {
      "s": 148.88,
      "e": 149.88,
      "text": "So on behalf of the"
    },
    {
      "s": 150.68,
      "e": 151.85,
      "text": "greatest team in the world,"
    },
    {
      "s": 152.42,
      "e": 153.09,
      "text": "good luck to you"
    },
    {
      "s": 153.09,
      "e": 154.55,
      "text": "and your crew on the final flight"
    },
    {
      "s": 154.55,
      "e": 155.85,
      "text": "of a true American icon."
    },
    {
      "s": 156.59,
      "e": 158.16,
      "text": "Let's light this fire one more time"
    },
    {
      "s": 158.16,
      "e": 158.89,
      "text": "Mike and witness"
    },
    {
      "s": 158.89,
      "e": 160.49,
      "text": "this great nation at it's best."
    },
    {
      "s": 160.49,
      "e": 162.93,
      "text": "The crew of Atlantis is ready for launch."
    },
    {
      "s": 164.13,
      "e": 167.57,
      "text": "T minus 35, 33 ..."
    },
    {
      "s": 167.57,
      "e": 170.8,
      "text": "Clock will hold at T minus 31 seconds due to a failue."
    },
    {
      "s": 172.04,
      "e": 173.27,
      "text": "And all of a sudden at 31"
    },
    {
      "s": 173.27,
      "e": 175.31,
      "text": "seconds, it's like, oh, we're stopping."
    },
    {
      "s": 175.68,
      "e": 177.11,
      "text": "And we all looked around like, huh?"
    },
    {
      "s": 177.11,
      "e": 178.04,
      "text": "What do you mean we're stopping?"
    },
    {
      "s": 178.18,
      "e": 179.18,
      "text": "You don't stop ."
    },
    {
      "s": 179.18,
      "e": 181.01,
      "text": "We have 31 seconds to lifting off."
    },
    {
      "s": 181.08,
      "e": 181.71,
      "text": "What had happened"
    },
    {
      "s": 181.71,
      "e": 183.65,
      "text": "was that the little beanie cap"
    },
    {
      "s": 183.65,
      "e": 185.65,
      "text": "that sits on top of the external tank,"
    },
    {
      "s": 185.85,
      "e": 187.29,
      "text": "you know, they get that out of the way"
    },
    {
      "s": 187.52,
      "e": 188.42,
      "text": "so so we can launch."
    },
    {
      "s": 188.72,
      "e": 189.66,
      "text": "And when they moved it"
    },
    {
      "s": 189.66,
      "e": 191.22,
      "text": "out of the way, there was a microswitch"
    },
    {
      "s": 191.22,
      "e": 192.59,
      "text": "that was supposed to the launch control"
    },
    {
      "s": 192.59,
      "e": 193.89,
      "text": "center, \"Hey, I'm out of the way."
    },
    {
      "s": 193.89,
      "e": 194.79,
      "text": "It's safe to launch.\""
    },
    {
      "s": 195.03,
      "e": 196.3,
      "text": "And that microsystem failed."
    },
    {
      "s": 196.3,
      "e": 197.66,
      "text": "And so the launch control center wasn't"
    },
    {
      "s": 197.66,
      "e": 199.23,
      "text": "sure if it was out of the way or not."
    },
    {
      "s": 199.23,
      "e": 202.03,
      "text": "OTC says we need to verify using a camera."
    },
    {
      "s": 202.03,
      "e": 203.87,
      "text": "But it's just amazing how seamlessly"
    },
    {
      "s": 203.87,
      "e": 205.34,
      "text": "the entire ground game team"
    },
    {
      "s": 205.34,
      "e": 206.91,
      "text": "ended up covering it and we ended up"
    },
    {
      "s": 206.91,
      "e": 208.51,
      "text": "launching just a few minutes late."
    },
    {
      "s": 208.51,
      "e": 211.08,
      "text": "This is CMC, we verify - retracted."
    },
    {
      "s": 211.91,
      "e": 212.88,
      "text": "It's like, oh, wait, we're launching!"
    },
    {
      "s": 213.25,
      "e": 216.72,
      "text": "Nine, eight, seven, six ..."
    },
    {
      "s": 216.72,
      "e": 218.08,
      "text": "[Roar of engines igniting]"
    },
    {
      "s": 218.08,
      "e": 221.12,
      "text": "All three engines up and burning ..."
    },
    {
      "s": 221.12,
      "e": 224.59,
      "text": "two, one, zero and liftoff,"
    },
    {
      "s": 224.59,
      "e": 226.69,
      "text": "the final liftoff of Atlantis"
    },
    {
      "s": 226.79,
      "e": 228.66,
      "text": "on the shoulders of the space shuttle,"
    },
    {
      "s": 228.93,
      "e": 231.6,
      "text": "America will continue the dream."
    },
    {
      "s": 232.2,
      "e": 233.3,
      "text": "Roll Program, Houston."
    },
    {
      "s": 234.5,
      "e": 235.84,
      "text": "Roger, roll Atlantis."
    },
    {
      "s": 241.87,
      "e": 242.84,
      "text": "Atlantis, station"
    },
    {
      "s": 242.84,
      "e": 244.44,
      "text": "on the big loop, we have you in sight."
    },
    {
      "s": 245.18,
      "e": 245.65,
      "text": "Excellent."
    },
    {
      "s": 245.65,
      "e": 246.48,
      "text": "We'll be there soon."
    },
    {
      "s": 246.48,
      "e": 248.75,
      "text": "Every time I was in the shuttle"
    },
    {
      "s": 248.75,
      "e": 250.42,
      "text": "and we were rendezvous and docking"
    },
    {
      "s": 250.62,
      "e": 251.55,
      "text": "to the space station."
    },
    {
      "s": 251.65,
      "e": 253.12,
      "text": "Every time I was awestruck"
    },
    {
      "s": 253.12,
      "e": 254.49,
      "text": "because it starts out"
    },
    {
      "s": 254.49,
      "e": 255.89,
      "text": "as this distant point of light."
    },
    {
      "s": 256.12,
      "e": 256.96,
      "text": "And then you keep getting"
    },
    {
      "s": 256.96,
      "e": 257.72,
      "text": "closer and closer."
    },
    {
      "s": 257.76,
      "e": 258.93,
      "text": "It's getting bigger and bigger."
    },
    {
      "s": 258.93,
      "e": 261.53,
      "text": "And it's like, wow, look what we did."
    },
    {
      "s": 262.03,
      "e": 263.8,
      "text": "This is a monster building"
    },
    {
      "s": 263.8,
      "e": 265.5,
      "text": "that we've built in space."
    },
    {
      "s": 266.1,
      "e": 267.53,
      "text": "Atlantis, Aladdin,"
    },
    {
      "s": 267.53,
      "e": 269.7,
      "text": "welcome to the International Space Station"
    },
    {
      "s": 269.7,
      "e": 271.17,
      "text": "for the last time."
    },
    {
      "s": 271.17,
      "e": 273.64,
      "text": "Big ol' Russian hug."
    },
    {
      "s": 275.31,
      "e": 276.34,
      "text": "How you doing guys?"
    },
    {
      "s": 276.34,
      "e": 277.84,
      "text": "The crew is just wonderful."
    },
    {
      "s": 278.04,
      "e": 279.41,
      "text": "We got along really well."
    },
    {
      "s": 279.51,
      "e": 280.55,
      "text": "You know, I think we"
    },
    {
      "s": 280.75,
      "e": 281.75,
      "text": "we laughed at each other"
    },
    {
      "s": 282.72,
      "e": 285.08,
      "text": "and we knew when it was time to work"
    },
    {
      "s": 285.08,
      "e": 286.45,
      "text": "and we knew when it was time to,"
    },
    {
      "s": 287.09,
      "e": 287.82,
      "text": "you know, relax."
    },
    {
      "s": 288.49,
      "e": 289.76,
      "text": "This is President Obama."
    },
    {
      "s": 289.76,
      "e": 290.66,
      "text": "Who am I talking to?"
    },
    {
      "s": 290.86,
      "e": 291.79,
      "text": "Hello, Mr. President."
    },
    {
      "s": 291.79,
      "e": 293.96,
      "text": "You're talking to the Increment 28 crew"
    },
    {
      "s": 293.96,
      "e": 295.06,
      "text": "and the crew of the space"
    },
    {
      "s": 295.06,
      "e": 295.93,
      "text": "shuttle Atlantis."
    },
    {
      "s": 296.56,
      "e": 297.2,
      "text": "Oh, that's funny see,"
    },
    {
      "s": 297.4,
      "e": 299.03,
      "text": "because I was just dialing out for pizza."
    },
    {
      "s": 299.2,
      "e": 300.33,
      "text": "I just want to say"
    },
    {
      "s": 300.8,
      "e": 302.1,
      "text": "how proud I am of all of you."
    },
    {
      "s": 302.33,
      "e": 303.74,
      "text": "Congratulations to NASA,"
    },
    {
      "s": 304.27,
      "e": 306.51,
      "text": "to all our international partners"
    },
    {
      "s": 306.71,
      "e": 308.01,
      "text": "and all the personnel past"
    },
    {
      "s": 308.01,
      "e": 309.61,
      "text": "and present who've spent countless hours"
    },
    {
      "s": 309.61,
      "e": 310.91,
      "text": "and untold effort"
    },
    {
      "s": 310.91,
      "e": 311.91,
      "text": "making the space shuttle"
    },
    {
      "s": 312.55,
      "e": 314.21,
      "text": "and the International Space Station"
    },
    {
      "s": 314.61,
      "e": 315.88,
      "text": "a unique part of our history."
    },
    {
      "s": 318.02,
      "e": 319.92,
      "text": "Transfer's the name of the game today,"
    },
    {
      "s": 319.92,
      "e": 322.36,
      "text": "as it will be for the next several days,"
    },
    {
      "s": 322.72,
      "e": 324.22,
      "text": "as the crew presses ahead"
    },
    {
      "s": 324.56,
      "e": 325.96,
      "text": "to complete the transfer"
    },
    {
      "s": 325.96,
      "e": 328.29,
      "text": "of almost five tons of supplies"
    },
    {
      "s": 328.56,
      "e": 329.9,
      "text": "from Raffaello to the"
    },
    {
      "s": 329.9,
      "e": 332.87,
      "text": "International Space Station that will help fortify"
    },
    {
      "s": 332.87,
      "e": 335.13,
      "text": "the complex for the next 12 months."
    },
    {
      "s": 336.07,
      "e": 337.14,
      "text": "I have never been"
    },
    {
      "s": 337.14,
      "e": 338.17,
      "text": "so busy my whole entire life"
    },
    {
      "s": 338.44,
      "e": 340.07,
      "text": "just executing that mission on orbit."
    },
    {
      "s": 340.51,
      "e": 342.18,
      "text": "We worked really hard,"
    },
    {
      "s": 342.38,
      "e": 343.98,
      "text": "but we had a lot of good time"
    },
    {
      "s": 343.98,
      "e": 344.64,
      "text": "while we're doing it."
    },
    {
      "s": 349.48,
      "e": 350.35,
      "text": "Good morning, Houston."
    },
    {
      "s": 350.75,
      "e": 353.55,
      "text": "We're getting ready for undock today."
    },
    {
      "s": 353.55,
      "e": 355.15,
      "text": "We get to do one last lap"
    },
    {
      "s": 355.15,
      "e": 356.86,
      "text": "with Atlantis around the ISS"
    },
    {
      "s": 356.86,
      "e": 359.02,
      "text": "and then start our trip home."
    },
    {
      "s": 359.02,
      "e": 360.86,
      "text": "Undocking confirmed."
    },
    {
      "s": 360.86,
      "e": 365.37,
      "text": "[bell ringing]"
    },
    {
      "s": 366.9,
      "e": 368.1,
      "text": "Atlantis departing"
