    {
      "s": 370.97,
      "e": 375.51,
      "text": "♫♫♫"
    },
    {
      "s": 376.14,
      "e": 377.91,
      "text": "There was one night before we landed,"
    },
    {
      "s": 378.31,
      "e": 380.18,
      "text": "we had all of our tasks done."
    },
    {
      "s": 380.78,
      "e": 382.45,
      "text": "We were ready the next day"
    },
    {
      "s": 382.45,
      "e": 383.75,
      "text": "to deorbit and come home."
    },
    {
      "s": 383.95,
      "e": 385.45,
      "text": "And the four of us had an opportunity"
    },
    {
      "s": 385.45,
      "e": 387.05,
      "text": "to hang out in the flight deck"
    },
    {
      "s": 387.35,
      "e": 388.72,
      "text": "and watch the world go by"
    },
    {
      "s": 388.72,
      "e": 390.19,
      "text": "and that's where we had a chance to"
