      "s": 394.66,
      "e": 397.36,
      "text": "♫♫♫"
    },
    {
      "s": 397.7,
      "e": 399.37,
      "text": "It's it's kind of interesting to be here"
    },
    {
      "s": 399.37,
      "e": 401.2,
      "text": "on the final night of a shuttle mission."
    },
    {
      "s": 401.63,
      "e": 402.77,
      "text": "Don't quite know what to think."
    },
    {
      "s": 402.8,
      "e": 404.0,
      "text": "We're just trying to take it all in."
    },
    {
      "s": 405.24,
      "e": 407.07,
      "text": "There was a little part of me that was sad."
    },
    {
      "s": 407.07,
      "e": 408.77,
      "text": "I thought this is an amazing vehicle."
    },
    {
      "s": 408.81,
      "e": 409.54,
      "text": "You know, here it is -"
